# Off-Target · .gitignore
# Weights, caches and raw generations stay out of git. Results that a reader needs
# to check a claim (small JSON, one figure, the two direction vectors) stay in.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.env
.venv/
*.safetensors
!results/*.safetensors
results/raw/
data/
explore/raw/
